Thunes APIs

1. Discovery

a. List of services per country - to add bank_id query param

To Gag: POST https://localhost:8443/thunes/v2/outbound/money-transfer/services
{
    "receiver": {
        "countryCode": "GHA"
    },
    "channelInfo": {
        "rrn": "111996657000",
        "bankId": "54",
        "channelId": "OMNI",
        "sourceSystemId": "ONMI"
    },
    "signature": ""
}

To Thunes:
GET: https://api-pre.mm.transferto.com/v2/money-transfer/services?country_iso_code=gha

Response:

[
   {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "MobileWallet"
   },
   {
      "id": 2,
      "name": "BankAccount"
   },
   {
      "id": 3,
      "name": "CashPickup"
   }
]

2. Payers

a. List payers available
Retrieves a list of all payers available for the caller, optionally filtered based on specified parameters.

To Gag: POST https://localhost:8443/thunes/v2/outbound/money-transfer/payers
{
    "receiver": {
		"serviceId": "1",
        "countryCode": "GHA",
		"currency": "USD"
    },
    "channelInfo": {
        "rrn": "111996657000",
        "bankId": "54",
        "channelId": "OMNI",
        "sourceSystemId": "ONMI"
    },
    "signature": ""
}

