3. Get payer details
Retrieve information for a given payer. The payer id must be supplied replacing {id} in the URI path

To Gat: POST https://localhost:8443/thunes/v2/outbound/money-transfer/payers/details

{
    "receiver": {
		"payerId": "3460"
    },
    "channelInfo": {
        "rrn": "111996657000",
        "bankId": "54",
        "channelId": "OMNI",
        "sourceSystemId": "ONMI"
    },
    "signature": "XkeRnkKsepCO+gq1EFulA=="
}

To Thunes:
GET: https://api-pre.mm.transferto.com/v2/money-transfer/payers/{id}

Response:

{
    "country_iso_code": "CHN",
    "currency": "CNY",
