4. Payer Rates and and transaction limits
- Retrieve rates for a given payer. The id of the payer must be supplied.

To Gag: POST https://localhost:8443/thunes/v2/outbound/money-transfer/payers/rates
{
    "receiver": {
		"payerId": "1243"
    },
    "channelInfo": {
        "rrn": "111996657000",
        "bankId": "54",
        "channelId": "OMNI",
        "sourceSystemId": "ONMI"
    },
    "signature": "XkeRnkKsepCO+gq1EFulA=="
}

To thunes
GET: https://api-pre.mm.transferto.com/v2/money-transfer/payers/369/rates

Response:
{
    "destination_currency": "GHS",
    "rates": {
        "B2B": {
            "USD": [
                {
                    "source_amount_max": null,
                    "source_amount_min": 0,
                    "wholesale_fx_rate": 11.8255756186879
                }
            ]
        },
        "C2C": {
            "USD": [
                {
                    "source_amount_max": null,
                    "source_amount_min": 0,
                    "wholesale_fx_rate": 11.8255756186879
                }
            ]
        }
    }
}

