6. Looup by BIC
- Retrieve list of payers’ identifier for a given SWIFT BIC code.
NOTE: Available for selected countries only

To Gag: POST https://localhost:8443/thunes/v2/outbound/money-transfer/lookups/bic
{
    "receiver": {
		"bicCode": "EQBLKENAXXX"
    },
    "channelInfo": {
        "rrn": "111996657000",
        "bankId": "54",
        "channelId": "OMNI",
        "sourceSystemId": "ONMI"
    },
    "signature": ""
}

To thunes
GET: https://api-pre.mm.transferto.com/v2/money-transfer/lookups/BIC/EQBLKENAXXX

Response:

[
    {
        "id": 1480
    }
]
